    "text": "Which of the given statement(s) about $\\mathbf{N}, \\mathbf{O}, \\mathbf{P}$ and $\\mathbf{Q}$ with respect to $\\mathbf{M}$ is (are) correct?\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/SZDMS4f1Uiss5dxX0H5SIuyEDMhH2xcNxLMB-alL7ao.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
